# Terraform
# Ignore Terraform state files and directories
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/terraform-local.tfstate
**/terraform-local.tfstate.backup

# Ignore Terraform plan output files
**/tfplan
**/*.tfplan

**/*.tfvars.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/.terraformrc
**/terraform.rc

# Keep environment configuration files (non-sensitive)
!infrastructure/environments/*.tfvars
!infrastructure/backend/*.tfbackend

# Ignore sensitive override files (if any)
infrastructure/environments/*-secrets.tfvars
infrastructure/environments/local-override.tfvars
infrastructure/environments/dev-override.tfvars
infrastructure/environments/prod-override.tfvars

